{"title":"Career Roadmap · Community Media Producer","role":"Community Media Producer","summary":"A Community Media Producer creates and manages media content designed to inform, represent, educate, and engage specific communities. The role can involve community radio, podcasts, local digital media, documentary/video production, social media, development communication, citizen journalism, NGO communication, and participatory storytelling.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Community Media Producer creates and manages media content designed to inform, represent, educate, and engage specific communities. The role can involve community radio, podcasts, local digital media, documentary/video production, social media, development communication, citizen journalism, NGO communication, and participatory storytelling."},{"type":"p","text":"The combination of Social Entrepreneurship + Development Communication is highly relevant because it provides an understanding of community needs, social issues, communication strategies, and social-impact initiatives. However, the student should add practical media-production skills to become employable."},{"type":"h","text":"Core positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["Development Communication","Community Engagement","Media Production","Digital Storytelling","Social Impact"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Expected Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Foundation & Entry"},{"text":"BA + media portfolio + internships + community projects"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Professional Producer"},{"text":"Community Media Producer → Senior Producer / Communication Specialist"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Media Lead / Communication Manager / Programme Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Strategic Leadership"},{"text":"Head of Communications / Community Media Director / Social Impact Media Consultant / Social Entrepreneur"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the BA","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student should not treat this degree as purely theoretical. By graduation, they should be capable of taking a community issue and converting it into a professional media product."},{"type":"h","text":"Core academic foundation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Development communication"},{"text":"Social entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Community development"},{"text":"Sociology"},{"text":"Economics and social policy"},{"text":"Communication theory"},{"text":"Media studies"},{"text":"Development issues"},{"text":"Rural and urban communities"},{"text":"Social research"},{"text":"Public policy basics"},{"text":"NGO and social-sector ecosystem"},{"text":"Social-impact measurement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Media-production foundation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Journalism fundamentals"},{"text":"Story development"},{"text":"Scriptwriting"},{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"Audio recording"},{"text":"Video production"},{"text":"Photography"},{"text":"Documentary production"},{"text":"Podcast production"},{"text":"Community radio"},{"text":"Social-media content"},{"text":"Digital publishing"},{"text":"Basic graphic design"},{"text":"Video editing"}]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Development","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Academic"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication fundamentals"},{"text":"Sociology"},{"text":"Development studies"},{"text":"Social entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Community structures"},{"text":"Media literacy"},{"text":"Research basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Basic Photoshop"},{"text":"Smartphone photography"},{"text":"Basic video shooting"},{"text":"Audio recor